@startuml breadpan-item-lifecycle
participant "Item 应用" as item
participant breadpan
participant 消费方

== 报到 ==
item -> breadpan: RegisterStatusNotifierItem(服务名 + 路径)
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（登记最小集）
breadpan --> 消费方: Added(id)

== 变更 ==
item -> breadpan: PropertiesChanged
item -> breadpan: New* 信号
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（合并通告）
breadpan --> 消费方: Changed(id)

== 同名换主 ==
item -> breadpan: NameOwnerChanged(旧属主 → 新属主)
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（属主重绑定、路由重探）
breadpan --> 消费方: OwnerChanged(id)

== 死亡 ==
item -> breadpan: NameOwnerChanged(属主 → "")
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（簿记移除）
breadpan --> 消费方: Removed(id)
@enduml
